{"id":820,"mal_id":820,"title":"Ginga Eiyuu Densetsu","englishTitle":"Legend of the Galactic Heroes","title_english":"Legend of the Galactic Heroes","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["LoGH","LotGH","Gin'eiden","GinEiDen","Heldensagen Vom Kosmosinsel"],"en":"Legend of the Galactic Heroes","ja":"銀河英雄伝説"},"synopsis":"The 150-year-long stalemate between the two interstellar superpowers, the Galactic Empire and the Free Planets Alliance, comes to an end when a new generation of leaders arises: the idealistic military genius Reinhard von Lohengramm, and the FPA's reserved historian, Yang Wenli.\n\nWhile Reinhard climbs the ranks of the Empire with the aid of his childhood friend, Siegfried Kircheis, he must fight not only the war, but also the remnants of the crumbling Goldenbaum Dynasty in order to free his sister from the Kaiser and unify humanity under one genuine ruler. Meanwhile, on the other side of the galaxy, Yang—a strong supporter of democratic ideals—has to stand firm in his beliefs, despite the struggles of the FPA, and show his pupil, Julian Mintz, that autocracy is not the solution.\n\nAs ideologies clash amidst the war's many casualties, the two strategic masterminds must ask themselves what the real reason behind their battle is.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"El estancamiento de 150 años entre las dos superpotencias interestelares, el Imperio Galáctico y la Alianza de Planetas Libres, llega a su fin cuando surge una nueva generación de líderes: el genio militar idealista Reinhard von Lohengramm y el reservado historiador de la FPA, Yang Wenli.\n\nMientras Reinhard asciende en las filas del Imperio con la ayuda de su amigo de la infancia, Siegfried Kircheis, debe luchar no sólo en la guerra, sino también contra los restos de la desmoronada dinastía Goldenbaum para liberar a su hermana del Kaiser y unificar a la humanidad bajo un gobernante genuino. Mientras tanto, al otro lado de la galaxia, Yang, un firme partidario de los ideales democráticos, tiene que mantenerse firme en sus creencias, a pesar de las luchas del FPA, y mostrarle a su alumno, Julian Mintz, que la autocracia no es la solución.\n\nMientras las ideologías chocan en medio de las muchas víctimas de la guerra, los dos autores intelectuales estratégicos deben preguntarse cuál es la verdadera razón detrás de su batalla.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"OVA","media_type":"ova","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1560,"average_episode_duration":1560,"startDate":"1988-01-08","start_date":"1988-01-08","endDate":"1997-03-17","end_date":"1997-03-17","season":"winter","year":1988,"start_season":{"year":1988,"season":"winter"},"episodes":110,"num_episodes":110,"score":9.02,"mean":9.02,"numListUsers":372853,"num_list_users":372853,"genres":[{"id":50,"name":"Adult Cast"},{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":38,"name":"Military"},{"id":24,"name":"Sci-Fi"},{"id":29,"name":"Space"}],"studios":[{"id":1269,"name":"K-Factory"},{"id":2256,"name":"Kitty Film Mitaka Studio"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/fWZu2vaHJg7M6iwqeFPO3rMHTi7.jpg","logo_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7brhNxFjohzRaHv05F8KTGrC80l.png","tmdb_id":"27660","tmdb_updated_at":"2026-11-21T22:31:39.068Z","images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1976/142016.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1976/142016l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1976/142016.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1976/142016l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1976/142016l.webp"}},"broadcast":null,"rank":11,"popularity":756,"rating":"r","num_scoring_users":90005,"nsfw":"white","source":"novel","background":"Legend of the Galactic Heroes was adapted from a series of ten novels, published 1982–87, by Yoshiki Tanaka. The novels won the Seiun Award for the best long-form Japanese science fiction in 1988.\n\nAt the start of its production the anime was distributed through a subscription system in which episodes were mailed to existing fans of the novels. It was made in four separate tranches over nearly a decade, with the production of side-stories continuing for several further years. The main series has the largest voice cast of any anime, with well over 300 voice actors, and it is the longest OVA series ever made.\n\nThe novels have also been adapted into a manga, a stage musical by the Takarazuka Revue and a number of games.","related_anime":[{"node":{"id":3016,"title":"Ginga Eiyuu Densetsu: Arata naru Tatakai no Overture","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/8/22498.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/8/22498l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"prequel","relation_type_formatted":"Prequel"},{"node":{"id":3371,"title":"Ginga Eiyuu Densetsu Gaiden","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/9/28463.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/9/28463l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"side_story","relation_type_formatted":"Side story"},{"node":{"id":3665,"title":"Ginga Eiyuu Densetsu Gaiden (1999)","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1682/134157.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1682/134157l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"side_story","relation_type_formatted":"Side story"},{"node":{"id":31433,"title":"Ginga Eiyuu Densetsu: Die Neue These - Kaikou","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1104/91793.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1104/91793l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"alternative_version","relation_type_formatted":"Alternative version"},{"node":{"id":36369,"title":"Ginga Eiyuu Densetsu: Die Neue These - Seiran 1","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1772/102667.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1772/102667l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"alternative_version","relat